# Placeable collision for swc_blg_corhis02.
# Preserve the original footprint and recesses.
# The main body runs from a buried foundation to the 19.66m roof.
# The two front corner pads are low pedestals whose visible top is local Z 0.88.
# Their collision stops 0.2 m lower, at local Z 0.68: the engine still blocks
# collision ending less than about 0.1 m under the walking plane, so a pad
# buried flush with the street would otherwise leave an invisible wall.
# Full height also blocks the elevated streets in Veles.
#NWmax PWKMESH ASCII
